es inspected with `PRAGMA table_info` to parse dynamic column schemas (`record_json`, `payload_json`, `user_id`, `email`, `status`).\\n   - **Correlated Logs**: Aggregates multi-line trace contexts by `trace_id` to link subject lookups with resource IDs and deletion/marker status (`support_replica.log`, `service_events_*.log`).\\n   - **JSON & Text Snapshots**: Structured parsing of customer profiles, support attachments, and handover documents.\\n   - **Temporal Invariant**: Strictly filters evidence created at or before each case's `audit_at` cutoff timestamp; evidence created later never alters the verdict.\\n\\n4. **Policy & Remediation Engine**:\\n   - Enforces `deletion_rules.csv` policies (FULL_RECORD deletion vs. REDACT/ANONYMIZE vs. statutory audit log\n<truncated 871 bytes>","Target":"\"The blank template at `dataset/output.csv` is provided as a reference. Your final generated file for submission must be the root-level `output.csv`.\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
